<title>UK: World Bank sets $250 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $250 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    14.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.855   PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.855    SPREAD	-4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT US TREASURY DUE JUNE 1999 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
